          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilistia baagaruka kurwana n'Abaisraeli. Daudi yaashuuma n'abashaija be, baarwana n'Abafilistia; ku baabaire nibakirwana, Daudi yaatandika kuruha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
