              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima haabaho orundi rugamba Gaasi. Okwo hakaba hariyo omushaija muraingwa munonga, owaabaire aine enkumu mukaaga ahari buri ngaro, n'enkumu z'ebigyere mukaaga ahari buri kigyere, zoona makumi abiri na ina; kandi nawe akaba ari ow'omuri baijukuru b'ebikaaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
